<urn:dsp:value:0aM2RsONQyaSR91fsZ9tmA> <https://ontology.dasch.swiss/dao#valueHasUUID> "0aM2RsONQyaSR91fsZ9tmA" <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
<urn:dsp:value:0aOkm-BvSWO0vdrN2d5jRw> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.dasch.swiss/dao#Value> <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
<urn:dsp:value:0aOkm-BvSWO0vdrN2d5jRw> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "m4r" <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
