<urn:dsp:value:X2vXIhcbQPiEgvopPhtzIw> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "zwei neue Textabschnitte:\n\"De maria\";\n\"Quare et p(rop)ter qua(m) vtilitatem christ(us) | volebat illudi.\"\nRubrizierung: Blau, Rot.\n" <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
