<urn:dsp:value:XKNIZ4h7QW6WO-uiSwZ8-A> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "vier neue Textabschnitte:\n\"De or(?)one et fructus impetratio(n)e.\"\n\"Hora sexta de baptismo ...\"\n\"Fundamentum meditationis.\"\n\"De miserabili penite(n)tia christi ...\"\nRubrizierung: Blau, Rot." <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
