<urn:dsp:value:dfxbvY9FQo61GgkNABjl6g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.dasch.swiss/dao#Value> <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
<urn:dsp:value:dfxbvY9FQo61GgkNABjl6g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Bordüre mit Meerwesen, Holzschnitt.\nKolorierung: Rot, Blau, Grün, Gelb, Braun, Grau." <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
<urn:dsp:value:dfxbvY9FQo61GgkNABjl6g> <https://ontology.dasch.swiss/dao#sourceProperty> <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0803/incunabula#hasDescription> <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
