<urn:dsp:value:icW9nHYbTWGCqsaSL24k4A> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Holzschnitt:\nVersuchung Jesu durch den Teufel, 6.6 x 4.9 cm.\nUnkoloriert." <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
<urn:dsp:value:icW9nHYbTWGCqsaSL24k4A> <https://ontology.dasch.swiss/dao#sourceProperty> <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0803/incunabula#hasDescription> <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
