<urn:dsp:value:kP2icMdpQdeM44cAqpUvzg> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "drei neue Textabschnitte:\n\"Hora sextadecima e crucifixione ...\";\n\"Fundamentu(m) meditiationis.\";\n\"de miserabili afflixione in crucifixione ...\".\nRubrizierung: Blau, Rot." <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
