<urn:dsp:value:ttvuFNurR7e2y_50jq0zvQ> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Beginn \"Ad numeros suos vt | Iohannem Bergmanum festine adeant.\" (Hartl 2001: Stultitia navis XVIII)." <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
<urn:dsp:value:ttvuFNurR7e2y_50jq0zvQ> <https://ontology.dasch.swiss/dao#sourceProperty> <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0803/incunabula#hasDescription> <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
