<urn:dsp:value:wUIVEgC9TC2LuiEhL-QaXg> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Fortsetzung der Vorrede  (Hartl 2001: Narrenschiff II); Feder (braun); Rubrizierung in Rot." <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
<urn:dsp:value:wUIVEgC9TC2LuiEhL-QaXg> <https://ontology.dasch.swiss/dao#sourceProperty> <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0803/incunabula#hasDescription> <urn:dsp:project:0803> .
